WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.770
- So you're now a
fan-favorite of the show.

00:00:01.770 --> 00:00:02.603
How does that feel?

00:00:02.603 --> 00:00:04.920
- I mean, I think I'm a favorite of some-

00:00:04.920 --> 00:00:05.880
- No, you're a fan favorite.

00:00:05.880 --> 00:00:09.270
Everyone is very excited you were coming.

00:00:09.270 --> 00:00:10.200
There are people on the crew

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:11.220
that were like, "she's coming?"

00:00:11.220 --> 00:00:12.509
I was like, "oh my gosh."

00:00:12.509 --> 00:00:14.370
- I think what's nice about this season

00:00:14.370 --> 00:00:15.960
is that everyone has somebody different

00:00:15.960 --> 00:00:16.890
to kinda plug into.

00:00:16.890 --> 00:00:18.750
We're all pretty different, you know.

00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:20.220
It's much more diverse, I think,

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:22.380
between age and ethnicity and background

00:00:22.380 --> 00:00:23.730
and age, I'm the old one.

00:00:23.730 --> 00:00:24.660
- Yeah.

00:00:24.660 --> 00:00:27.600
Yeah, no one thinks about that, yeah.

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:28.890
I was like, "no one thinks 'old'

00:00:28.890 --> 00:00:29.723
when they look at you."

00:00:29.723 --> 00:00:31.260
They just think "damn, I'm not that cool."

00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:32.399
- Yeah, no, that's not
what they're thinking,

00:00:32.399 --> 00:00:33.232
but okay, thanks.

00:00:33.232 --> 00:00:34.065
- They are thinking that.

00:00:34.065 --> 00:00:35.520
Wait, did Andy Cohen have to actually

00:00:35.520 --> 00:00:36.690
convince you to do it?

00:00:36.690 --> 00:00:38.190
- I mean, "convince" is a strong word.

00:00:38.190 --> 00:00:40.020
We had a come-to-Jesus, so we knew

00:00:40.020 --> 00:00:42.900
each other prior and at the very end,

00:00:42.900 --> 00:00:44.160
we were getting ready to sort of

00:00:44.160 --> 00:00:45.660
do the final decision that he and I

00:00:45.660 --> 00:00:48.150
spoke on the phone and
he said exactly that

00:00:48.150 --> 00:00:49.440
he didn't want to convince me.

00:00:49.440 --> 00:00:50.580
He was like, "you have
to make the decision

00:00:50.580 --> 00:00:52.860
on your own because
it's a really vulnerable

00:00:52.860 --> 00:00:55.290
situation and anything that you don't want

00:00:55.290 --> 00:00:56.430
people to know, they will know."

00:00:56.430 --> 00:00:57.900
These fans are-

00:00:57.900 --> 00:00:59.310
they're like forensic scientists.

00:00:59.310 --> 00:01:01.590
If any of you are out there, I know you.

00:01:01.590 --> 00:01:02.940
I know you know everything.

